.SH NAME
__hhs_dirs - Display the list of currently remembered directories or select one to switch into.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
usage: __hhs_dirs [OPTION]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Display the list of currently remembered directories or select one to switch into.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
$1..$N (Opt)
Optional flags or arguments passed to the builtin 'dirs' command.
.SH DETAILS
.nf

Options:
         -c : Clear the directory stack
         -s : List the directory stack (space separated and absolute paths)
         -l : List all remembered directories (stack + dirs file) (decorated absolute paths)
         -p : Print each directory on a new line
         -v : Print the directory stack with variable index notation
    +N / -N : Display or rotate to the Nth entry in the directory stack
.fi
